WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.627
- [Announcer:] Brogon inside...

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:03.628
Oh!
[Crowd roaring]

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.132
- I wanna win a championship here. 

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:11.636
I feel as though I fit in to the identity of this team very well as an underdog,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.431
and this team always exceeds the expectations.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:18.476
It takes after the Midwest city that really fights for everything they have.

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.187
I've been asked to be the leader of this team,

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.981
affect the game on both ends of the floor,

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:24.607
flip criticism on its head

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:25.734
and be elite.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:27.902
A lot of the time I try to block it out,

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.572
but for the criticism that I do hear,

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.531
it's fuel to my fire.

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:43.418
Technology is allowing the game to be viewed more widely.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:46.087
It's made it more interesting for fans, being able to see the different views,

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:49.507
being able to see the game sort of through a different lens and a different angle.

00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:56.598
For me personally, I feel as though I fit in to the identity of this team

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:58.725
as an underdog that overperforms,

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:01.061
that proves people wrong.

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:02.687
- [Announcer:] Great move.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:05.774
- I think we have the building blocks to be really, really good, to be elite.

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:08.234
That will allow us to win a championship ultimately. 

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:11.154
I'mma lead with my voice.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:14.991
I'mma make sure people organize so they know what they're doing.

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.578
Then I'mma lead by example.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.414
I'm a guy that's gonna be fearless on the court so that my teammates can follow.

